{"version":1,"slug":"Others__MATHEMATICAL_SIGN_SYMBOLS_(4)","path":"Others/MATHEMATICAL SIGN& SYMBOLS (4).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"MATHEMATICAL SIGN& SYMBOLS (4).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , what is the value of:</p><p>168 P 7 Q 3 R 23 S 5 = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376;, Q &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X &#2361;&#2376;, R &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, S &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p><p>168 P 7 Q 3 R 23 S 5 = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">88</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">88</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">90</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">90</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">92</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">92</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">94</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">94</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , then the equation will be: </p><p>168 &div; 7 x 3 + 23  -  5 = ?</p><p>24 x 3 + 23  -  5 = ?</p><p>72 + 23  -  5 = ?</p><p>95  -  5 = ? </p><p>So, ? = 90</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , what is the value of:</p><p>391 Q 11 P 23 R 17 S 13 = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376;, Q &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X &#2361;&#2376;, R &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, S &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p><p>391 Q 11 P 23 R 17 S 13 = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">189</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">189</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">191</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">191</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">193</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">193</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">195</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">195</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , then the equation will be:</p><p>391 x 11 &div; 23 + 17  -  13 = ?</p><p>4301 &div; 23 + 17  -  13 = ?</p><p>187 + 17  -  13 = ?</p><p>204  -  13 = ?</p><p>So, ? = 191</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , what is the value of:</p><p>525 P 21 Q 2 S 7 R 31 = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376;, Q &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X &#2361;&#2376;, R &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, S &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p><p>525 P 21 Q 2 S 7 R 31 = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">72</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">72</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">74</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">74</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">76</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">76</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">78</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">78</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , then the equation will be:</p><p>525 &div; 21 x 2  -  7 + 31 = ?</p><p>25 x 2  -  7 + 31 = ?</p><p>50  -  7 + 31 = ? </p><p>81  -  7 = ?</p><p>So, ? = 74</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , what is the value of:</p><p>182 P 14 Q 3 R 13 S 5 = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; P &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376;, Q &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X &#2361;&#2376;, R &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, S &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;:</p><p>182 P 14 Q 3 R 13 S 5 = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">45</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">45</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">47</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">47</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">49</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">49</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">51</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">51</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>P means &div;, Q means  X , R means +, S means  - , then the equation will be: </p><p>182 &div; 14 x 3 + 13  -  5 = ?</p><p>13 x 3 + 13  -  5 = ?</p><p>39 + 13  -  5 = ?</p><p>52  -  5 = ?</p><p>So, ? = 47</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?</p><p>120 &div; 20 + 10  X  5 - 40 = 90</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>120 &div; 20 + 10 X 5 - 40 = 90</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">+ and &div;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and &div;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X  and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and  X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and  X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>120 &div; 20 + 10  X  5 - 40 = 90</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a): + and &div;</p><p>120 + 20 &div; 10  X  5 - 40 = 90</p><p>120 + 10  -  40</p><p>130  -  40</p><p><b>90 = 90</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (a)</b> is correct.</p><p>Option (b):  X  and  - </p><p>120 &div; 20 + 10 - 5  X  40 = 90</p><p>6 + 10  -  5  X  40</p><p>6 + 10  -  200</p><p>16  -  200</p><p>-184 &#8800; 90</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (c): &div; and  X </p><p>120 &#1093; 20 + 10 - 5 &div; 40 = 90</p><p>120 &#1093; 20 + 10  -  0.125</p><p>2400 + 10  -  0.125</p><p>2410  -  0.125</p><p>2409.875 &#8800; 90</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (d): + and  - </p><p>120 &div; 20 - 10  X  5 + 40 = 90</p><p>6 - 10  X  5 + 40</p><p>6  -  50 + 40</p><p>-4 &#8800; 90</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?</p><p>45 - 4  X  100 + 210 &div; 3 = 150</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>45 - 4 X 100 + 210 &div; 3 = 150</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">X  and +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X  and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>45 - 4  X  100 + 210 &div; 3 = 150</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a):  X  and +</p><p>45 - 4 + 100  X  210 &div; 3</p><p>45  -  4 + 7000</p><p>7041 &#8800; 150</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (b):  X  and -</p><p>45  X  4 - 100 + 210 &div; 3</p><p>45  X  4 - 100 + 70</p><p>180  -  100 + 70</p><p><b>150 = 150</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (b)</b> is correct.</p><p>Option (c): &div; and +</p><p>45 - 4  X  100 &div; 210 + 3</p><p>45  -  1.9047 + 3</p><p>48  -  1.9047</p><p>46.0952 &#8800; 150</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect</p><p>Option (d): + and -</p><p>45 + 4  X  100 - 210 &div; 3</p><p>45 + 4  X  100 - 70</p><p>45 + 400  -  70</p><p>445 - 70</p><p>375 &#8800; 150</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?</p><p>250 - 100 + 25 &div; 15  X  5 = 321</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>250 - 100 + 25 &div; 15 X 5 = 321</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X  and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>250 - 100 + 25 &div; 15  X  5 = 321</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a): &div; and +</p><p>250 - 100 &div; 25 + 15  X  5 = 321</p><p>250  -  4 + 75</p><p>325  -  4</p><p><b>321 = 321</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (a)</b> is correct.</p><p>Option (b):  X  and  - </p><p>250 &#1093; 100 + 25 &div; 15 - 5 = 321</p><p>25000 + 25/15  -  5</p><p>24996.67 &#8800; 321</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect</p><p>Option (c): &div; and -</p><p>250 &div; 100 + 25  -  15  X  5 = 321</p><p>2.5 + 25  -  15  X  5</p><p>2.5 + 25  -  75</p><p>27.5  -  75</p><p>-47.5 &#8800; 75</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect</p><p>Option (d): + and -</p><p>250 + 100  -  25 &div; 15  X  5 = 321</p><p>250 + 100  -  8.33</p><p>350  -  8.33</p><p>341.67 &#8800; 321</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?</p><p>88 - 22  X  5 + 120 &div; 10 = 186</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>88 - 22 X 5 + 120 &div; 10 = 186</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and  X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and  X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and  X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and  X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and -</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>88 - 22  X  5 + 120 &div; 10 = 186</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a): &div; and  X </p><p>88 - 22 &div; 5 + 120 &#1093; 10 = 186</p><p>88  -  4.4 + 1200</p><p>1288  -  4.4</p><p>1283.6 &#8800; 186</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is incorrect</p><p>Option (b): + and  X </p><p>88  -  22 + 5 &#1093; 120 &div; 10 = 186</p><p>88  -  22 + 60</p><p>148  -  22</p><p>126 &#8800; 186</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect</p><p>Option (c): + and  - </p><p>88 + 22  X  5 - 120 &div; 10 = 186</p><p>88 + 22  X  5  -  12</p><p>88 + 110  -  12</p><p>198  -  12</p><p><b>186 = 186</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (c)</b> is correct</p><p>Option (d): &div; and  - </p><p>88 &div; 22  X  5 + 120 - 10 = 186</p><p>20 + 120  -  10</p><p>140  -  10</p><p>130 &#8800; 186</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct?</p><p>150  X  50 &div; 75 + 2 - 100 = 127</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>150 X 50 &div; 75 + 2 - 100 = 127</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and  X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and  X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X  and +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and -</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>150  X  50 &div; 75 + 2 - 100 = 127</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a): &div; and  X </p><p>150 &div; 50 &#1093; 75 + 2 - 100 = 127</p><p>3 &#1093; 75 + 2  -  100</p><p>225 + 2  -  100</p><p>227  -  100</p><p><b>127 = 127</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (a)</b> is correct</p><p>Option (b): + and  - </p><p>150  X  50 &div; 75 - 2 + 100 = 127</p><p>100  -  2 + 100</p><p>200  -  2</p><p>198 &#8800; 127</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect</p><p>Option (c):  X  and +</p><p>150 + 50 &div; 75 &#1093; 2 - 100 = 127</p><p>150 + 1.33  -  100</p><p>151.33  -  100</p><p>51.33 &#8800; 127</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect</p><p>Option (d): &div; and  - </p><p>150  X  50 - 75 + 2 &div; 100 = 127</p><p>7500  -  75 + 0.02</p><p>7500.02  -  75</p><p>7425.02 &#8800; 127</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the equation correct? </p><p>11 + 10  X  90 &div; 3 - 120 = 20</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>11 + 10 X 90 &div; 3 - 120 = 20</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X  and +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X  and +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and  X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; and  X</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>We have the original equation as:-</p><p>11 + 10  X  90 &div; 3 - 120 = 20</p><p>On checking each option one by one, after interchanging we get:-</p><p>Option (a): + and -</p><p>11  -  10  X  90 &div; 3 + 120 = 20</p><p>11  -  300 + 120</p><p>131  -  300</p><p>-169 &#8800; 20</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is incorrect</p><p>Option (b):  X  and +</p><p>11  X  10 + 90 &div; 3 - 120 = 20</p><p>11  X  10 + 30  -  120</p><p>110 + 30  -  120</p><p>140  -  120</p><p><b>20 = 20</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, <b>option (b)</b> is correct</p><p>Option (c): &div; and -</p><p>11 + 10  X  90  -  3 &div; 120 = 20</p><p>11 + 10  X  90  -  0.025</p><p>11 + 900  -  0.025</p><p>911  -  0.025</p><p>910.975 &#8800; 20</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect</p><p>Option (d): &div; and  X </p><p>11 + 10 &div; 90  X  3 - 120 = 20</p><p>11 + 0.33  -  120</p><p>11.33  -  120</p><p>-108.67 &#8800; 20</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect</p>","marks":2,"section":n